{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Hamachi the Psychotic Killer</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/21d3914019014dee1d5e3a43a3c40054.avif?t=1759115180\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The platformer game where you can play as the BAD GUY.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/85207609fcf0f90e1f1b5768cd3bd55b.avif?t=1759115180\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamachi the Psychotic Killer is a Platformer game where you can play as the BAD GUY, and under demonic influence, your goal is to kill everything in your path.. If you want to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.poster.avif?t=1759115180\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.webm?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.mp4?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slaughter innocent civilians and paint the town red with Hamachi's weapon of choice: the axe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.poster.avif?t=1759115180\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.webm?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.mp4?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasionally, you\u2019ll come across a chainsaw that grants invincibility and kills anything you touch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.poster.avif?t=1759115180\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.webm?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.mp4?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With blood fresh on your hands you're now wanted by the police. Run away, or they will catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.poster.avif?t=1759115180\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.webm?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.mp4?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current iteration of  early access  offers 4 playable worlds, and two Challenge Levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b6a45d92b0b47863c6f19bf8e91afe9a.avif?t=1759115180\" data-has-big width=1560 height=975 /></span>Throughout development, the game will receive new Challenge Levels! These levels are short but offer more difficulty!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing, sparing or remaining neutral leads to one of the three main endings of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three distinct routes: Pacifist, Neutral, or Genocide, plus a hidden ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique, demonic bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-original, vibrant pixel art paired with an energetic soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups that enhance your abilities and make taking down enemies a breeze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium Sushi delivered by Penelope to keep Hamachi at peak performance.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a cat level. i forgot where it is, but avoid it at all costs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with love by mostly one person.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Seek Help","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3355690/4b658c2a4c2ded4c0513cf836aa8d9ca6e06f6d4.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355690?t=1759115180","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355690?t=1759115180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/8b6f989d054dac5050cb4d83df133ca107ac1d77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759115180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/8b6f989d054dac5050cb4d83df133ca107ac1d77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759115180","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content"},"demos":[{"appid":3368500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Hamachi the Psychotic Killer</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/21d3914019014dee1d5e3a43a3c40054.avif?t=1759115180\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The platformer game where you can play as the BAD GUY.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/85207609fcf0f90e1f1b5768cd3bd55b.avif?t=1759115180\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamachi the Psychotic Killer is a Platformer game where you can play as the BAD GUY, and under demonic influence, your goal is to kill everything in your path.. If you want to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.poster.avif?t=1759115180\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.webm?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.mp4?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slaughter innocent civilians and paint the town red with Hamachi's weapon of choice: the axe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.poster.avif?t=1759115180\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.webm?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.mp4?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasionally, you\u2019ll come across a chainsaw that grants invincibility and kills anything you touch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.poster.avif?t=1759115180\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.webm?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.mp4?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With blood fresh on your hands you're now wanted by the police. Run away, or they will catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.poster.avif?t=1759115180\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.webm?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.mp4?t=1759115180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current iteration of  early access  offers 4 playable worlds, and two Challenge Levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b6a45d92b0b47863c6f19bf8e91afe9a.avif?t=1759115180\" data-has-big width=1560 height=975 /></span>Throughout development, the game will receive new Challenge Levels! These levels are short but offer more difficulty!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing, sparing or remaining neutral leads to one of the three main endings of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three distinct routes: Pacifist, Neutral, or Genocide, plus a hidden ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique, demonic bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-original, vibrant pixel art paired with an energetic soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups that enhance your abilities and make taking down enemies a breeze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium Sushi delivered by Penelope to keep Hamachi at peak performance.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a cat level. i forgot where it is, but avoid it at all costs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with love by mostly one person.</p></li></ul>","developers":["gavinoriley"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/header.jpg?t=1759115180","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Hamachi the Psychotic Killer \u00a9 Gavin ORiley 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3355690/794165633/b47efde6cc30285f84e10725449818a8c24af06b/1750438522/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750441168","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3355690/794165633/b47efde6cc30285f84e10725449818a8c24af06b/1750438522/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750441168","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3355690/794165633/b47efde6cc30285f84e10725449818a8c24af06b/1750438522/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750441168","id":257074495,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257074495/movie480.mp4?t=1750441168","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257074495/movie_max.mp4?t=1750441168"},"name":"","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257074495/ed40f75b9537c6872c9517aec908cb8024db8f11/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750441168","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257074495/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750441168","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257074495/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750441168"}}],"name":"Hamachi the Psychotic Killer","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Hamachi the Psychotic Killer - $4.99 USD","packageid":1187716,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":499}],"title"